# Harness settings of this project, shared by every developer: this file is versioned. Read by
# the odoo-harness engine (installed with the plugin) and passed to docker compose.
# Written by the init skill from what it detected in the project; edit when the project changes.
# What differs between developers (the harness Odoo's port, the dev database mode, logins and
# passwords) is never set here: each developer sets it in harness/dev.local.env (not versioned,
# created by the init and update skills; its comments explain each value).
COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME={{PROJECT_NAME}}
# Oldest odoo-harness engine this project accepts (odoo-harness where). An older engine refuses
# to run, so every teammate verifies with the same rules. The update skill raises it.
HARNESS_VERSION={{HARNESS_VERSION}}
ODOO_VERSION={{ODOO_VERSION}}
# Odoo image of the test runtime. With the fogits dev stack (docker-compose/first_build), the
# dev stack's image, used as it is. Otherwise, when ODOO_DOCKERFILE is set, odoo-harness init
# builds the project's own Dockerfile into ODOO_IMAGE (same Python dependencies as production).
ODOO_IMAGE={{ODOO_IMAGE}}
ODOO_DOCKERFILE={{ODOO_DOCKERFILE}}
# The dev stack's Odoo source (../addons), mounted read-only instead of the image's; empty to
# run the image's Odoo.
ODOO_SOURCE_DIR={{ODOO_SOURCE_DIR}}
POSTGRES_IMAGE={{POSTGRES_IMAGE}}
# Addon folders, relative to the repository root, comma-separated.
# CUSTOM_ADDONS: the project's own modules.
CUSTOM_ADDONS={{CUSTOM_ADDONS}}
# THIRD_PARTY_ADDONS: OCA and other vendors; the agent may change them too.
THIRD_PARTY_ADDONS={{THIRD_PARTY_ADDONS}}
# ENTERPRISE_DIR: Odoo Enterprise checkout, outside the repository (read-only); empty if unused.
# The team's layout (../enterprise); a developer whose checkout is elsewhere overrides it in
# harness/dev.local.env.
ENTERPRISE_DIR={{ENTERPRISE_DIR}}
# Disposable database used for tests and e2e, with demo data. Never point this at real data.
TEST_DB={{TEST_DB}}
# Git: task branches start from BASE_BRANCH; merge requests target it.
BASE_BRANCH={{BASE_BRANCH}}
GITLAB_URL={{GITLAB_URL}}
GITLAB_PROJECT={{GITLAB_PROJECT}}
# Paths the agent must never edit, comma-separated, relative to the repo root: deployment
# files are changed by a human. ENTERPRISE_DIR, Odoo core with odoo-bin and Odoo S.A.
# modules are always protected.
PROTECTED_PATHS={{PROTECTED_PATHS}}
